      "text": "FSD（Supervised）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789389110,
      "updated": 1789389124
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f0300000000006bcf6a",
      "text": ">[カメラ映像]と[AI]を活用して[市街地]などのあらゆる道路で運転をサポートする高度な運転支援システム",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603588,
      "updated": 1789603623
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa7ea0700000000002864a4",
      "text": "\t[https://www.tesla.com/ja_jp/fsd Full Self-Driving]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789389319,
      "updated": 1789603606
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa7e97800000000009a5c52",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789389177,
      "updated": 1789389177
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6500000000006bcf6b",
      "text": "自動運転解禁国",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603686,
      "updated": 1789603694
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6d00000000006bcf6d",
      "text": "\tカナダ、メキシコ・・・可。米国と同レベル。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603694,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf6e",
      "text": " 南米・・・不可。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf6f",
      "text": " 中国本土・・・一部ユーザーがv13のみ可。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf70",
      "text": " 香港・・・不可。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf71",
      "text": " 韓国・・・米国製車両（S/X/サイバートラック）のみ可。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf72",
      "text": " オーストラリア・・・可。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf73",
      "text": " EU・・・オランダのみ可。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf74",
      "text": " イギリス・・・不可。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf75",
      "text": " ロシア・・・そもそもテスラが売ってない。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6e00000000006bcf76",
      "text": " 日本・・・不可。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603695,
      "updated": 1789603695
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab2f6500000000006bcf6c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789603686,
      "updated": 1789603686
    },
